<title>POLAND: BPH JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 29.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>BPH JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 29.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 29.89 vs   23.60</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   41.24 vs   29.07</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 77.15 vs   55.27</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     109.96 vs   86.73</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					144.10 vs  153.69</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  220.90 vs  219.27</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		386.94 vs  335.83</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     608.59 vs  518.03</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Przemyslowo-</p>
<p>Handlowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
